  "_comment": "Cards that exist only for the text-change test (tests/unit/effects/test_text_change.py). Never part of a deck list; loaded by the test registry fixture alongside data/cards/. `t_new_blood` is New Blood's second line. `t_goblin_lord` is the card the second half of the mechanic is for -- a lord whose anthem names its own tribe, so a text change has to rewrite the words inside its ability and not only its type line. `t_vampire_lord` is the witness on the other side: an anthem belonging to somebody else, which sees the converted creature only if the substitution reaches `_matches_printed`. `t_goblin_herald` carries the same word in a triggered ability and an activated ability, which resolve through `stack.ability_of` rather than through the statics path. `t_granter` exists only to make `_ability_statics` non-empty, which pushes `abilities_of` off its fast path and through `_derived_abilities` -- the second reader of the printed list, and the one a mutation test showed was otherwise uncovered.",
